hints.pseudocode:
team = array of -1 (unknown) for every person
for each person s with team -1:
  team[s] = 0; queue = [s]
  while queue not empty:
    u = next in queue
    for each person v in conflict with u:
      if team[v] == -1: team[v] = 1 - team[u]; add v to queue
      else if team[v] == team[u]: return false
return true
